    given-names: Andrii
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9072-2976"
    affiliation: 'National Technical University of Ukraine "Igor Sikorsky Kyiv Polytechnic Institute"'
keywords:
  - multisource time series
  - point-in-time consistency
  - historical invariance
  - temporal data model
  - record availability
  - evolving news metadata
  - chronological clustering
  - historical state reconstruction
  - data leakage
  - reproducibility
